---
import Public from "../layouts/Public.astro";
---

<Public title="Pricing" description="Simple, transparent pricing for teams of all sizes.">
  <style>
    .pricing-header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: var(--spacing-3xl) 0;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .pricing-header h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 2.5rem);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .pricing-header p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }

    .pricing-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: var(--spacing-lg);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3xl);
    }

    .pricing-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      padding: var(--spacing-xl);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      position: relative;
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
    }

    .pricing-card.featured {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      border: 2px solid var(--accent);
      transform: scale(1.02);
    }

    .pricing-card.featured:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2);
    }

    .pricing-badge {
      position: absolute;
      top: -15px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-lg);
      border-radius: 9999px;
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .pricing-card h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    }

    .pricing-card > p:first-of-type {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .pricing-amount {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .pricing-amount span {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    .pricing-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .pricing-list li {
      padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }

    .pricing-list li:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .pricing-cta {
      display: block;
      padding: var(--spacing-md);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
    }

    .pricing-cta-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
    }

    .pricing-cta-primary:hover {
      background: var(--accent-hover);
    }

    .pricing-cta-secondary {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .pricing-cta-secondary:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .faq-section {
      padding: var(--spacing-3xl) 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .faq-section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3xl);
    }

    .faq-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .faq-item {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .faq-question {
      padding: var(--spacing-lg);
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: none;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      transition: all var(--transition-base);
    }

    .faq-question:hover {
      background: var(--bg-surface);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .faq-question::after {
      content: "+";
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      transition: transform var(--transition-base);
    }

    .faq-item[open] .faq-question::after {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      padding: var(--spacing-lg);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: var(--text-base);
      line-height: 1.6;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .contact-section {
      margin-top: var(--spacing-3xl);
      padding: var(--spacing-xl);
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .contact-section h3 {
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .contact-section p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .contact-section a {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .contact-section a:hover {
      color: var(--accent-hover);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .pricing-card.featured {
        transform: scale(1);
      }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- Pricing Header -->
    <section class="pricing-header">
      <h1>Transparent Pricing</h1>
      <p>All plans include real-time flame graphs and cost attribution. Scale from free to enterprise.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Pricing Cards -->
    <div class="pricing-grid">
      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h2>Free</h2>
        <p>Perfect to get started</p>
        <div class="pricing-amount">$0<span>/month</span></div>
        <ul class="pricing-list">
          <li>✓ Unlimited sessions</li>
          <li>✓ Real-time flame graphs</li>
          <li>✓ Basic cost breakdown</li>
          <li>✓ Loop detection</li>
          <li>✓ 7-day retention</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/sign-up" class="pricing-cta pricing-cta-secondary">Start Free</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card featured">
        <div class="pricing-badge">Most Popular</div>
        <h2>Pro</h2>
        <p>For growing teams</p>
        <div class="pricing-amount">$49<span>/month</span></div>
        <ul class="pricing-list">
          <li>✓ 10k sessions/month</li>
          <li>✓ Advanced cost breakdown</li>
          <li>✓ Custom alerts (email)</li>
          <li>✓ Loop & anomaly detection</li>
          <li>✓ 30-day retention</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/sign-up" class="pricing-cta pricing-cta-primary">Start Free Trial</a>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-card">
        <h2>Business</h2>
        <p>For enterprises</p>
        <div class="pricing-amount">$299<span>/month</span></div>
        <ul class="pricing-list">
          <li>✓ Unlimited sessions</li>
          <li>✓ Team workspaces</li>
          <li>✓ Webhook alerts</li>
          <li>✓ Priority support</li>
          <li>✓ 90-day retention</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/sign-up" class="pricing-cta pricing-cta-secondary">Contact Sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-container">
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Can I change my plan anytime?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes, absolutely. You can upgrade or downgrade your plan at any time. Changes take effect at the next billing cycle.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">What happens if I exceed my session limit?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            We'll notify you when you're approaching your limit. You can upgrade to a higher plan instantly, or purchase additional sessions as needed.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Do you offer discounts for annual billing?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            We offer a 20% discount when you pay annually. Contact our sales team at sales@flamegraph.dev for details.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">What if I need a custom plan?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            For enterprise needs, custom session limits, or specialized features, please contact our sales team. We're happy to work with you.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question">Is there a free trial for paid plans?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes, Pro and Business plans come with a 14-day free trial. No credit card required to start.
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section -->
    <div class="contact-section">
      <h3>Questions? We're here to help</h3>
      <p>Contact us for custom pricing, enterprise features, or any other questions.</p>
      <a href="mailto:sales@flamegraph.dev">sales@flamegraph.dev</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Public>
